### Requisições prontas para o IntelliJ (HTTP Client) ou VS Code (extensão REST Client)
### Ordem: pegar o token (demo, registrar ou logar) -> copiar na variável abaixo -> usar o resto
@base = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = COLE_AQUI_O_TOKEN

### Token da conta demo, sem senha (modo demo, padrão)
POST {{base}}/auth/demo

### Criar conta (já devolve o token)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bruno",
  "email": "bruno@email.com",
  "password": "senha-forte-123"
}

### Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bruno@email.com",
  "password": "senha-forte-123"
}

### Quem sou eu
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registrar gasto
POST {{base}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Compras no mercado",
  "amount": 80.50,
  "category": "GROCERIES"
}

### Registrar gasto inválido (400 com erros por campo)
POST {{base}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "",
  "amount": -5,
  "date": "2099-01-01"
}

### Registrar uma receita (a categoria define que e entrada de dinheiro)
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "description": "Salario de setembro",
  "amount": 5200.00,
  "category": "SALARY"
}

### Listar so as receitas
GET {{base}}/transactions?type=INCOME
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar (filtros opcionais; resposta paginada em "content")
GET {{base}}/transactions?category=GROCERIES&start=2026-09-01&end=2026-09-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar a segunda pagina, 10 por pagina
GET {{base}}/transactions?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Resumo do mes atual (gastos por categoria, total recebido e saldo)
GET {{base}}/transactions/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Baixar os lancamentos do mes em CSV (abre no Excel)
GET {{base}}/transactions/export.csv?start=2026-09-01&end=2026-09-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Relatorio do mes (entrou, saiu, sobrou, maiores gastos, orcamentos e metas)
GET {{base}}/reports/monthly
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar uma meta de economia
POST {{base}}/goals
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Viagem",
  "targetAmount": 6000.00,
  "deadline": "2027-01-31"
}

### Guardar dinheiro na meta (nao e gasto, nao entra no resumo)
POST {{base}}/goals/{{goalId}}/deposits
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "amount": 300.00
}

### Listar as metas com o progresso
GET {{base}}/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cadastrar uma conta que se repete todo mes
POST {{base}}/recurring
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "description": "Aluguel",
  "amount": 1500.00,
  "category": "HOUSING",
  "dayOfMonth": 10
}

### Listar as contas fixas, com a proxima data de cada uma
GET {{base}}/recurring
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Definir limite mensal
POST {{base}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "GROCERIES",
  "monthlyLimit": 500.00,
  "month": "2026-09"
}

### Orçamentos do mês com quanto já foi gasto
GET {{base}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Só os alertas
GET {{base}}/budgets/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lumi por texto
POST {{base}}/assistant/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Gastei 42 reais e 90 centavos na farmácia",
  "conversationId": "principal"
}

### Pergunta com memória (mesma conversa)
POST {{base}}/assistant/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Quanto foi mesmo o valor que eu acabei de falar?",
  "conversationId": "principal"
}

### Apagar a conversa
DELETE {{base}}/assistant/conversation?conversationId=principal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Áudio -> transcrição + resposta em JSON
POST {{base}}/assistant/voice/text
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="recording-1.m4a"
Content-Type: audio/m4a

< ./src/test/resources/audio/recording-1.m4a
--boundary--

### Áudio -> resposta em MP3 (perfil OpenAI; 503 no groq)
POST {{base}}/assistant/voice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="recording-1.m4a"
Content-Type: audio/m4a

< ./src/test/resources/audio/recording-1.m4a
--boundary--

### Vincular o WhatsApp à conta
PUT {{base}}/auth/me/phone
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "(19) 99999-9999"
}

### Estado da conexão com o WhatsApp (perfil whatsapp)
GET {{base}}/whatsapp/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Gerar o QR code para parear (perfil whatsapp)
POST {{base}}/whatsapp/connect
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
